font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="c-261" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="f-797">140,911</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards, including <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="c-262" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="f-798">120,150</ix:nonFraction> shares to non-employee directors, with vesting periods of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-799">one</span> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-264" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="f-800">three years</ix:nonNumeric>. The fair value of the restricted stock awards is equal to the closing share price on the date of grant.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:NonvestedRestrictedStockSharesActivityTableTextBlock" id="f-801" continuedAt="f-801-1" escape="true"><div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table summarizes restricted stock activity for the six months ended June 30, 2026:</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:68.542%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.780%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width